OL,3,AAssad regime planned US journalist's
OL,4,Akidnap for weeks, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS journalist Austin Tice, who
OL,7,Fdisappeared in Syria in 2012, was
OL,8,Fkidnapped in a calculated operation
OL,9,Fwhich was more than a month in the
OL,10,Fplanning, the BBC can reveal.
OL,12,FA member of the group which detained
OL,13,FTice has also claimed the abduction was
OL,14,Fsanctioned by Syria's leader at the
OL,15,Ftime, President Bashar al-Assad.
OL,17,FTice was seen getting into a car with a
OL,18,Fdriver he knew and trusted. For years,
OL,19,Fmany assumed they had stumbled upon a
OL,20,Fgovernment checkpoint, and that the
OL,21,Fabduction of the journalist had been
OL,22,Fopportunistic.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
